      "name": "E-Designations",
      "description": "This data set contains information and locations of (E) Designations, including CEQR\nEnvironment Requirements (Table 1) and CEQR Restrictive Declarations (Table 2), in\nAppendix C of the Zoning Resolution. An (E) Designation provides notice of the\npresence of an environmental requirement pertaining to potential hazardous materials\ncontamination, high ambient noise levels or air emission concerns on a particular\ntax lot.\n\n\nAll previously released versions of this data are available on the <a href=\"https://www.nyc.gov/content/planning/pages/resources/datasets/e-designations\">DCP Website: BYTES of the BIG APPLE</a>. Current version: 20251106",
